{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I appreciate you Lilia. Your home is a sanctuary. Your company, a blessing. I hope to be by your side in the final battle.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:00:10.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744993998095253504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I think I'm finally getting use to being apart of this community.\" She gives a small laugh \"For a while I still felt like an outsider but last night.. with you, Copper, Goose, everyone... I felt like I was apart of you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:02:18.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744994533548228699","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I think you telling me to join the knights was a big part of that. Thank you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:03:19.782000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744994792148041811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"Cato smiles warmly to her. \"You are a part of the town. The knights needed you. A brave warrior, with a kind heart, and a lovely smile. Who isn't afraid to put her foot down, when she doesn't agree with something going on. The knights needed you. And so did I.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:05:34.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744995358605836290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"Well, then I plan on staying around for a long while.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:06:36.888000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744995618870788124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"Lilia starts to move around the mometos she gathered the night before placing them in their correct place. \"The crow took your offering last night, correct?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:09:25.990000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744996328135852094","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"Cato nods. \"My old weapon. I was glad to see it gone. The memories it holds, cannot bother me anymore. The future looks bright.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:10:19.770000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744996553705652405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"She nods \"The Raven Queens work has been done. I was surprised at some of the offerings made, including yours.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:12:22.796000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744997069713965074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
