{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"Well, look around.\" She gestures to the shelves of trickests, shells, rocks, feathers, dried plants, viles of soil, ash, water \"Some people put things in with not just sentimental value, but also monetary, tools and weapons. Lucky offered a page from his spellbook and received a mark from the Raven Queen.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:15:40.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744997899925979195","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"The items I collect are usually discarded things that hold a peice our imprint on it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:16:47.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744998181674287246","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"Cato nods. \"I think mine fit with what you collect. The person I used to be. The thing I did not need anymore. I wasn't just by you for the sake of the spell Lilia. I couldn't bear to see you get hurt. I care about you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:19:09.407000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744998775164239893","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
