{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"He sits in the joy. Waits in her company. Peaceful. \"Your wings were beautiful. You cannot fly correct?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:22:51.739000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744999707692105809","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I cannot. I used to be able to before, but honestly I prefer my feet on the ground.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:24:19.379000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745000075280777246","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"He gives a mischievous smile. \"Do you want to try it again? To fly with your wings extended. Feel the wind in your hair.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T19:25:31.272000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745000376822005912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
